hostGeneratedDeclarations.description:
Atomically apply semantic setup operations to saved JSON and publish a new outputPath. Requires the revision from studio_inspect_project; stale revisions and unsupported methods are rejected. Never alters the input or an open browser. Returns a compact summary, not the full model.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__airpocket_studio__studio_edit_project(args: {
  // Optional exact resulting input revision from studio_preview_edit; rejects a different transaction result before publication.
  expectedResultingRevision?: string;
  expectedRevision: string;
  operations: Array<{
  // Typed positional JSON arguments of the selected semantic method. Numbers, strings, booleans, null, records and nested arrays are represented explicitly; exact method arity and physical/nested data remain runtime-validated.
  args: Array<number | string | boolean | null | { [key: string]: unknown; } | Array<number | string | boolean | null | { [key: string]: unknown; } | Array<number | string | boolean | null | { [key: string]: unknown; } | Array<unknown>>>>;
  method: "selectTriangles" | "selectCadFace" | "selectPlanarRegion" | "selectCylindricalRegion" | "clearSelection" | "addCondition" | "removeCondition" | "selectCondition" | "replaceConditionRegion" | "reapplyConditionRegion" | "setMaterial" | "setMaterialProperties" | "setMaterialPreset" | "applyCatalogMaterial" | "setStudy" | "setMeshSettings" | "setInputProvenance" | "setAnalysisIntent";
}>;
  // Absolute local JSON file path
  outputPath: string;
  // Absolute local JSON file path
  path: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Preview semantic input edits without writing files or changing a browser. Returns the exact resulting input revision, bounded changed JSON pointers, compact summary and Node physical preflight. A valid edit can return preflight.allowed false with missing-input diagnostics. Nested operation payloads remain validated by the actual semantic methods; no physical input is inferred.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__airpocket_studio__studio_preview_edit(args: {
  expectedRevision: string;
  method?: "wasm-pcg" | "pcg" | "pcg-strict" | "mfem-wasm";
  mode?: "legacy" | "quantitative" | "exploratory";
  operation?: "solve" | "mesh";
  operations: Array<{
  // Positional arguments of the selected semantic method; nested material, boundary and provenance validation is runtime-only.
  args: Array<number | string | boolean | null | { [key: string]: unknown; } | Array<number | string | boolean | null | { [key: string]: unknown; } | Array<number | string | boolean | null | { [key: string]: unknown; } | Array<unknown>>>>;
  method: "selectTriangles" | "selectCadFace" | "selectPlanarRegion" | "selectCylindricalRegion" | "clearSelection" | "addCondition" | "removeCondition" | "selectCondition" | "replaceConditionRegion" | "reapplyConditionRegion" | "setMaterial" | "setMaterialProperties" | "setMaterialPreset" | "applyCatalogMaterial" | "setStudy" | "setMeshSettings" | "setInputProvenance" | "setAnalysisIntent";
}>;
  // Absolute local JSON file path
  path: string;
  size?: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```
